#. Text id 122 (0x7A). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.122"
msgid "follow the wumpa fruit! collect 100 wumpa fruit to earn an extra life."
msgstr ""
"suivez le wumpa ! collectez 100 wumpas pour gagner une vie supplémentaire."

#. Text id 123 (0x7B). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.123"
msgid "press B to spin and break crates!"
msgstr "appuyez sur B pour tourner et casser les caisses !"

#. Text id 124 (0x7C). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.124"
msgid "press A to jump!"
msgstr "appuyez sur A pour sauter !"

#. Text id 125 (0x7D). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.125"
msgid ""
"bouncy crates allow you to bounce on them several times before breaking."
msgstr "caisses sauteuses : sauter plusieurs fois pour les casser."

#. Text id 126 (0x7E). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.126"
msgid "crates can be stacked. spin or jump on them to get past."
msgstr "empilage de caisses. tourner ou sauter pour passer."

#. Text id 127 (0x7F). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.127"
msgid ""
"do not spin tnt crates or they will explode! jump on them to start the timer."
msgstr ""
"ne pas tournez sur les caisses de tnt sinon elles explosent. sautez dessus "
"pour les activer."

#. Text id 128 (0x80). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.128"
msgid "break the aku aku crate to summon me. i will protect you from one hit."
msgstr ""
"cassez la caisse aku pour obtenir le masque aku aku, qui protège d'un "
"mauvais coup."

#. Text id 129 (0x81). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.129"
msgid "press A two times to jump even higher."
msgstr "appuyez deux fois sur A pour sauter plus haut."

#. Text id 130 (0x82). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.130"
msgid "press R while jumping to body slam. this breaks steel crates."
msgstr "appuyez sur R en sautant pour écraser et briser les caisses en acier."

#. Text id 131 (0x83). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.131"
msgid "the crash crate will give you an extra life."
msgstr "la caisse crash donne une vie supplémentaire."

#. Text id 132 (0x84). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.132"
msgid "hold A while bouncing to bounce even higher"
msgstr "maintenez A en rebondissant pour rebondir plus haut."

#. Text id 133 (0x85). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.133"
msgid "press R while running to slide."
msgstr "appuyer sur R en courant pour glisser."

#. Text id 134 (0x86). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.134"
msgid ""
"tnt crates can break other crates.  just jump on one to start the timer."
msgstr ""
"les caisses tnt peuvent casser les "
"autres                                        caisses. sautez dessus pour "
"les activer."

#. Text id 135 (0x87). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.135"
msgid "do not touch green nitro crates or they will explode!"
msgstr "ne touchez pas les caisses nitro vertes sinon elles explosent."

#. Text id 136 (0x88). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.136"
msgid "spin the slot crate before it becomes unbreakable!"
msgstr "tournez sur la caisse changeante avant qu'elle ne devienne incassable."

#. Text id 137 (0x89). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.137"
msgid "the green nitro switch box destroys all nitro crates in a level."
msgstr "le boîtier nitro vert détruit toutes les caisses nitro du niveau."

#. Text id 138 (0x8A). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.138"
msgid "did you collect the purple crystal? did you break all of the crates?"
msgstr ""
"avez-vous trouvé le cristal violet ? avez-vous cassé toutes les caisses ?"

#. Text id 139 (0x8B). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.139"
msgid "deep in the heart of hyperspace..."
msgstr "loin dans les profondeurs de l'hyper-espace..."

#. Text id 140 (0x8C). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.140"
msgid ""
"uka uka: that incompetent neo cortex. he cannot do anything right! his last "
"scheme to shrink the earth failed miserably! you have been a great asset to "
"the cause of evil over the years n. tropy."
msgstr ""
"uka uka : cet incompétent de neo cortex. il ne peut rien faire comme il "
"faut ! sa dernière tentative pour rétrécir la terre a misérablement échoué ! "
"tu as été très utile à la cause du mal n. tropy."

#. Text id 141 (0x8D). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.141"
msgid "n. tropy: thank you, my lord."
msgstr "n. tropy : merci, monseigneur."

#. Text id 142 (0x8E). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.142"
msgid ""
"uka uka: that is why i trust you with the task of aiding me in universal "
"domination."
msgstr ""
"uka uka : c'est pourquoi j'ai décidé de te confier la tâche de m'aider à "
"dominer l'univers."

#. Text id 143 (0x8F). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.143"
msgid "n. tropy: great uka uka, i am honored! and i have the perfect scheme."
msgstr "n. tropy : grand uka uka, je suis honoré ! et j'ai le plan parfait."

#. Text id 144 (0x90). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.144"
msgid ""
"n. tropy: allow me to harness my powers of time and space to peer into the "
"future..."
msgstr ""
"n. tropy : permettez-moi d'user de mes pouvoirs sur le temps et l'espace "
"pour voir dans le futur..."

#. Text id 145 (0x91). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.145"
msgid ""
"n. tropy: of course! since those wretched bandicoots keep thwarting us, the "
"solution is to get them on our side. and i know just the fellow for the job."
msgstr ""
"n. tropy : bien entendu ! ces affreux bandicoots déjouent toujours nos "
"plans. la solution, c'est de les faire passer de notre côté. et je sais à "
"qui demander de faire ce travail."

#. Text id 146 (0x92). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.146"
msgid "uka uka: a new recruit?"
msgstr "uka uka : une nouvelle recrue ?"

#. Text id 147 (0x93). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.147"
msgid "n. tropy: indeed. meet my secret weapon."
msgstr "n. tropy : absolument. voici n. trance, mon arme secrete."

#. Text id 148 (0x94). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.148"
msgid "n. trance: i am n. trance, master of hypnotism!"
msgstr "n. trance: je suis n. trance, maître de l'hypnose !"

#. Text id 149 (0x95). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.149"
msgid "meanwhile... "
msgstr "pendant ce temps..."

#. Text id 150 (0x96). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.150"
msgid "coco: crash, heeeeeelp!"
msgstr "coco : crash, à l'aiiiiiide !"

#. Text id 151 (0x97). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.151"
msgid ""
"aku aku: crash! wake up! coco and crunch have been abducted! find me a power "
"crystal so i can look into what's going on! hurry!"
msgstr ""
"aku aku : crash ! debout ! coco et crunch ont été enlevés ! trouve-moi un "
"cristal de pouvoir que je vois ce qui se passe ! vite !"

#. Text id 152 (0x98). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.152"
msgid "aku aku: oh, no! watch out crash!"
msgstr "aku aku : oh, non ! attention, crash !"

#. Text id 153 (0x99). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.153"
msgid "aku aku: i've got you crash!"
msgstr "aku aku : je te tiens, crash !"

#. Text id 154 (0x9A). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.154"
msgid "n. tropy: something is holding on to crash. we need more power!"
msgstr "n. tropy : quelque chose retient crash. il nous faut plus d'énergie !"

#. Text id 155 (0x9B). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.155"
msgid "aku aku: this vortex must be the work of n. tropy."
msgstr "aku aku : c'est sans doute l'œuvre de n. tropy."

#. Text id 156 (0x9C). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.156"
msgid "n. tropy: i've finally captured that infernal bandicoot!"
msgstr "n. tropy : j'ai enfin capturé cet infernal bandicoot !"

#. Text id 157 (0x9D). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.157"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. Text id 158 (0x9E). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.158"
msgid ""
"n. tropy: i finally got all you obnoxious bandicoots! would you do the "
"honors, n. trance!"
msgstr ""
"n. tropy : je vous tiens enfin tous, maudits bandicoots ! a toi de jouer, n. "
"trance !"

#. Text id 159 (0x9F). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.159"
msgid "n. trance: with pleasure!"
msgstr "n. trance : avec plaisir !"

#. Text id 160 (0xA0). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.160"
msgid "somewhere else in hyperspace..."
msgstr "ailleurs, dans l'hyper-espace..."

#. Text id 161 (0xA1). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.161"
msgid ""
"aku aku: that took almost all the power i had, crash. good job getting the "
"power crystal before you were pulled into the vortex. but, i'll need a lot "
"more crystals if we are to put an end to n. tropy's plans."
msgstr ""
"aku aku : j'ai presque épuisé mon énergie. heureusement que tu m'as amené ce "
"cristal avant d'être attiré dans le vortex. mais il me faut beaucoup "
"d'autres cristaux si nous voulons faire échouer les plans de n. tropy."

#. Text id 162 (0xA2). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.162"
msgid ""
"aku aku: that floating island up ahead will allow us to go to different "
"worlds and find crystals. hopefully we can find coco and crunch and stop n. "
"tropy!"
msgstr ""
"aku aku : cette île flottante devant nous, elle nous permettra d'aller dans "
"d'autres mondes et d'y trouver des cristaux. espérons que nous trouverons "
"coco et crunch et que nous pourrons arrêter n. tropy !"

#. Text id 163 (0xA3). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.163"
msgid "crunch: oohh man...brainwashed again! thanks for saving me crash."
msgstr ""
"crunch : ohh, dur... encore un lavage de cerveau ! merci de m'avoir sauvé, "
"crash."

#. Text id 164 (0xA4). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.164"
msgid ""
"aku aku: good news crash. the crystals you've collected have allowed me to "
"open up a new area of the island. we can get to new worlds from there."
msgstr ""
"aku aku : bonne nouvelle, crash. les cristaux que tu as trouvés m'ont permis "
"d'ouvrir un nouveau secteur de l'île. nous pouvons aller dans d'autres "
"mondes désormais."

#. Text id 165 (0xA5). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.165"
msgid ""
"coco: oh, crash, thank you. how did you break out of n. trance's hypnosis?"
msgstr "coco : oh, crash, merci. comment as-tu brisé l'hypnose de n. trance ?"

#. Text id 166 (0xA6). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.166"
msgid ""
"aku aku: something strange happened when you were being pulled into the "
"vortex, crash. coco saw someone in n. tropy's secret base that looked like "
"you. i'll try to find out who while you go collect more crystals."
msgstr ""
"aku aku : il s'est passé une chose étrange quand tu as été attiré dans le "
"vortex, crash. coco a vu quelqu'un dans la base secrète de   n. tropy qui te "
"ressemblait. je vais essayer de savoir qui c'est pendant que tu ramènes "
"d'autres cristaux."

#. Text id 167 (0xA7). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.167"
msgid ""
"n. tropy: n. trance, you blundering idiot! that was not crash! it was some "
"sort of... fake crash!"
msgstr ""
"n. tropy : n. trance, tu es un idiot ! ce n'était pas crash ! c'est une "
"sorte de... faux crash !"

#. Text id 168 (0xA8). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.168"
msgid ""
"n. trance: how was i supposed to know? he fooled you too. besides, they will "
"never find our hideout. not in a million years!"
msgstr ""
"n. trance : comment pouvais-je le deviner ? vous ne l'avez pas remarqué non "
"plus. de plus, ils ne trouveront jamais notre repaire. pas avant des "
"millions d'années !"

#. Text id 169 (0xA9). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.169"
msgid ""
"aku aku: good job crash! with a few more crystals, i'll be able to open the "
"vortex to n. tropy's hideout!"
msgstr ""
"aku aku : bon travail, crash ! avec quelques cristaux de plus, je pourais "
"ouvrir le vortex qui mène au repaire de n. tropy !"

#. Text id 170 (0xAA). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.170"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. Text id 171 (0xAB). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.171"
msgid "aku aku: yes!  we've made it to n. tropy's secret base."
msgstr "aku aku: bravo ! nous sommes arrivés à la base secrete de n.tropy."

#. Text id 172 (0xAC). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.172"
msgid "n. tropy: n. trance, you fool! they have found us! destroy them!"
msgstr ""
"n. tropy : n. trance, espèce d'idiot ! ils nous ont trouvés ! détruis-les !"

#. Text id 173 (0xAD). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.173"
msgid "n. trance: it should have taken a million years to find us... how?"
msgstr ""
"n. trance : ils auraient dû mettre un million d'années à nous trouver... "
"comment ?"

#. Text id 174 (0xAE). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.174"
msgid ""
"aku aku: time does not pass in the vortex... i had all the time i needed to "
"find you!"
msgstr ""
"aku aku : le temps ne s'écoule pas dans le vortex... j'ai eu tout le temps "
"nécessaire pour vous trouver!"

#. Text id 175 (0xAF). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.175"
msgid ""
"n. tropy: you have one last chance to stop them. do not disappoint me again!"
msgstr ""
"n. tropy : tu as une dernière chance de les arrêter. ne me déçois pas !"

#. Text id 176 (0xB0). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.176"
msgid "n. trance: destroy all bandicoots!"
msgstr "n. trance : détruis tous les bandicoots !"

#. Text id 177 (0xB1). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.177"
msgid "n. tropy: noooo! i can't defeat all these wretched bandicoots myself!"
msgstr ""
"n. tropy : nooon ! je ne peux pas vaincre tous ces misérables bandicoots "
"tout seul !"

#. Text id 178 (0xB2). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.178"
msgid "n. tropy: but mark my words. i'll be baaaack!"
msgstr "n. tropy : mais croyez-moi. je reviendrai !"

#. Text id 179 (0xB3). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.179"
msgid ""
"aku aku: good job crash! you've rescued the other bandicoots from n. tropy "
"and defeated n. trance! too bad n. tropy got away. if only we had all of the "
"gem shards, i could re-open his space vortex and you could go after him!"
msgstr ""
"aku aku : bon travail, crash! tu as libéré les autres bandicoots de l'empire "
"de n.tropy et vaincu             n.trance! dommage que n.trance se soit "
"échappé. si seulement nous avions toutes les parties de gemmes de couleurs, "
"je pourrais ouvrir à nouveau et tu seras en mesure de le poursuivre."

#. Text id 180 (0xB4). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.180"
msgid "the end??"
msgstr "la fin ?"

#. Text id 181 (0xB5). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.181"
msgid ""
"aku aku: good job, crash! you've rescued the other bandicoots from n. tropy "
"and defeated n. trance!  lucky thing you collected all of the gem shards. i "
"can use them to re-open his space vortex and you can go after him!"
msgstr ""
"aku aku : bon travail, crash! tu as libéré les autres bandicoots de l'empire "
"de n.tropy et vaincu             n.trance! comme tu as trouvé toutes les "
"parties de gemmes de couleurs, je peux ouvrir le vortex à nouveau et tu peux "
"le poursuivre!"

#. Text id 182 (0xB6). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.182"
msgid ""
"aku aku: congratulations everyone, for defeating n. tropy and capturing him! "
"let's take a picture to celebrate!"
msgstr ""
"aku aku : félicitations à tous pour avoir vaincu n. tropy et l'avoir "
"capturé ! faisons une photo pour fêter ça !"

#. Text id 183 (0xB7). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.183"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. Text id 184 (0xB8). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.184"
msgid ""
"uka uka: that's it! no more underlings! next time you will face a real "
"adversary!"
msgstr ""
"uka uka : ca suffit ! plus de subalternes ! la prochaine fois, vous "
"affronterez un vrai adversaire!"

#. Text id 185 (0xB9). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.185"
msgid "the end... for now..."
msgstr "la fin... pour l'instant..."

#. Text id 186 (0xBA). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.186"
msgid ""
"aku aku: crash, these mayan ruins can only be traversed by using one of your "
"favorite toys, the atlasphere. look out for nitro traps and ledges."
msgstr ""
"aku aku : crash, ces ruines mayas ne peuvent être traversées qu'en utilisant "
"un de tes jouets préférés, l'atlasphère. attention aux caisses de nitro et "
"aux fossés. "

#. Text id 187 (0xBB). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.187"
msgid ""
"aku aku: now it is your turn to use the atlasphere, crunch.  but be "
"careful!  n. tropy has added some new dangers."
msgstr ""
"aku aku : c'est à toi d'utiliser l'atlasphère, crunch. mais attention! n. "
"tropy a ajouté d'autres obstacles."

#. Text id 188 (0xBC). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.188"
msgid ""
"aku aku: crash, in this water world you will need to use your wakeboard to "
"collect the power crystal. the waters are guarded by a vicious shark so be "
"careful!"
msgstr ""
"aku aku : crash, dans ce monde aquatique, tu dois utiliser ta planche pour "
"trouver les cristaux. les eaux sont gardées par un féroce requin, alors fais "
"attention !"

#. Text id 189 (0xBD). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.189"
msgid ""
"aku aku: the next power crystal is located in space, coco. you must use your "
"space suit and rocket tug to retrieve it.  n. tropy has sent a huge fireball "
"that will destroy the crystal if you do not move fast enough, but i have "
"created turbo gates to help you stay ahead of the danger."
msgstr ""
"aku aku : le prochain cristal de pouvoir est dans l'espace, coco. tu dois "
"utiliser la combinaison spatiale et la fusée pour le retrouver. n. tropy a "
"envoyé une énorme boule de feu pour détruire le cristal si tu ne vas pas "
"assez vite, mais j'ai ajouté des portes turbo pour que tu sois toujours "
"devant."

#. Text id 190 (0xBE). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.190"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. Text id 191 (0xBF). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.191"
msgid "Resume"
msgstr "Continuer"

#. Text id 192 (0xC0). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.192"
msgid "Exit"
msgstr "Quitter"

#. Text id 193 (0xC1). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.193"
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "Pause"

#. Text id 194 (0xC2). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.194"
msgid "roll your atlasphere to the exit."
msgstr "faites rouler l'atlasphère jusqu'à la sortie."

#. Text id 195 (0xC3). Not named yet.
msgctxt "ui.text.195"
msgid "use <#> to brake and <$> to speed up!"
msgstr "appuyez sur <#> pour freiner et <$> pour accélérer."
